    "specPath": "specs/200-the-dependency-policy-has-an-owner-and-records/spec.md",
    "status": "approved",
    "summary": "`deny.toml` is the dependency gate CI runs (spec 135), and no spec owns it: 135 names it only as a reference. This spec claims it, adds `.cargo/audit.toml` so `cargo audit` reads the same policy, and commits the `cargo vet` records under `supply-chain/` with six published audit sets imported. Each file enters the content hash and the governed scope, so an edit to the dependency policy stales the ledger and needs an owner.\n",
